msgid "有关工具类型的更多详情，请参阅 :doc:`concepts`。"
msgstr "See :doc:`concepts` for more details on tool types."

#: ../../env_modules.rst:96
msgid "状态持久化与 resume"
msgstr "State Persistence and Resume"

#: ../../env_modules.rst:98
msgid ""
"如果模块带有动态内存态，例如计数器、收件箱或队列，可以实现 workspace 持久化，让仿真在中断后通过 ``--resume`` "
"继续运行（详见 :doc:`cli`）。基类提供一对可覆盖的钩子，但**不规定状态格式、文件名或目录**。 模块可以自行选择布局；通常把状态写到 "
"``<workspace_root>/state/ENV_STATE.json``。"
msgstr ""
"If a module has dynamic in-memory state, such as counters, inboxes, or "
"queues, it can implement workspace persistence so the simulation can "
"continue after an interruption with ``--resume``; see :doc:`cli`. The "
"base class provides two overridable hooks, but **does not prescribe the "
"state format, file name, or directory**. Each module can choose its own "
"layout; state is usually written to "
"``<workspace_root>/state/ENV_STATE.json``."

#: ../../env_modules.rst:106
msgid "方法"
msgstr "Method"

#: ../../env_modules.rst:107
msgid "作用"
msgstr "Role"

#: ../../env_modules.rst:108
msgid "``async def to_workspace(self, workspace_path=None)``"
msgstr "``async def to_workspace(self, workspace_path=None)``"

#: ../../env_modules.rst:109
msgid ""
"把动态状态写入 workspace。society 会在每步结束时通过 router 调用它。建议用 "
"``agentsociety2.storage.workspace_state.atomic_write_text`` 原子写。"
msgstr ""
"Write dynamic state into the workspace. Society calls this through the "
"router at the end of each step. Use "
"``agentsociety2.storage.workspace_state.atomic_write_text`` for atomic "
"writes."

#: ../../env_modules.rst:111
msgid "``async def restore(self, workspace_path) -> bool``"
msgstr "``async def restore(self, workspace_path) -> bool``"

#: ../../env_modules.rst:112
msgid ""
"从 workspace 恢复动态状态，用于 resume 路径。返回值表示是否加载到了快照，供 router 区分 fresh 和 "
"resume。该方法只会在 ``__init__`` 与 ``init()`` 之后调用，因此可以安全覆盖 ``init()`` 里的重置。"
msgstr ""
"Restore dynamic state from the workspace on the resume path. The return "
"value indicates whether a snapshot was loaded, allowing the router to "
"distinguish fresh startup from resume. This method is called only after "
"``__init__`` and ``init()``, so it can safely override resets performed in"
" ``init()``."

#: ../../env_modules.rst:115
msgid "``def _bind_workspace(self, workspace_path)``"
msgstr "``def _bind_workspace(self, workspace_path)``"

#: ../../env_modules.rst:116
msgid "绑定到 workspace 目录（幂等），创建该目录。由 ``to_workspace``/``restore`` 自动调用。"
msgstr ""
"Bind the module to a workspace directory idempotently and create that "
"directory. Called automatically by ``to_workspace`` / ``restore``."

#: ../../env_modules.rst:117
msgid ""
"``classmethod async def from_workspace(cls, workspace_path, "
"**init_kwargs)``"
msgstr ""
"``classmethod async def from_workspace(cls, workspace_path, "
"**init_kwargs)``"

#: ../../env_modules.rst:118
msgid ""
"重建一个可用的模块：先执行 ``cls(**init_kwargs)``，再调用 ``restore``。resume 时，actor 会从 "
"``SOCIETY.json`` 读取 ``init_kwargs``。"
msgstr ""
"Rebuild a ready module by running ``cls(**init_kwargs)`` and then calling"
" ``restore``. During resume, the actor reads ``init_kwargs`` from "
"``SOCIETY.json``."

#: ../../env_modules.rst:121
msgid "实现示例（参考 ``SimpleSocialSpace`` / ``EconomySpace`` / ``MobilitySpace``）："
msgstr ""
"Implementation example; compare ``SimpleSocialSpace``, ``EconomySpace``, "
"and ``MobilitySpace``:"

#: ../../env_modules.rst:167
msgid "约定："
msgstr "Conventions:"

#: ../../env_modules.rst:169
msgid ""
"JSON 键只能是字符串。``dict[int, ...]`` 应使用 ``str(k)`` 存、``int(k)`` 读，或用 "
"``agentsociety2.env.base.dump_int_map``/``load_int_map`` 辅助。"
msgstr ""
"JSON keys must be strings. For ``dict[int, ...]``, write keys with "
"``str(k)`` and read them back with ``int(k)``, or use "
"``agentsociety2.env.base.dump_int_map`` / ``load_int_map``."

#: ../../env_modules.rst:171
msgid ""
"pydantic 模型用 ``model_dump(mode=\"json\")`` 和 ``model_validate``；datetime "
"用 ``isoformat``/``fromisoformat``；``set`` 存 ``sorted(list)``。"
msgstr ""
"For pydantic models, use ``model_dump(mode=\"json\")`` and "
"``model_validate``. For datetime values, use ``isoformat`` / "
"``fromisoformat``. Store ``set`` values as ``sorted(list)``."

#: ../../env_modules.rst:173
msgid ""
"``asyncio.Lock``、外部子进程、预训练模型权重等不可或不必序列化的对象不存盘，由 ``__init__``/``init()`` "
"重建（如 ``MobilitySpace`` 的 routing server、``SocialMediaSpace`` 的推荐器）。"
msgstr ""
"Do not persist objects that cannot or need not be serialized, such as "
"``asyncio.Lock``, external subprocesses, or pretrained model weights. "
"Recreate them in ``__init__`` / ``init()``, as with the routing server in"
" ``MobilitySpace`` or the recommender in ``SocialMediaSpace``."

#: ../../env_modules.rst:176
msgid ""
"持久化与 replay 表（``_agent_state_columns`` 和 "
"``_env_state_columns``）相互独立。replay 面向 分析，是 append-only 的时序数据；workspace "
"面向恢复，会覆写最新状态。详见 :doc:`storage`。"
msgstr ""
"Persistence and replay tables (``_agent_state_columns`` and "
"``_env_state_columns``) are independent. Replay is append-only "
"time-series data for analysis; workspace persistence is for recovery and"
" overwrites the latest state. See :doc:`storage`."

#: ../../env_modules.rst:180
msgid "注册模块"
msgstr "Registering Modules"

#: ../../env_modules.rst:193
msgid "完整示例"
msgstr "Complete Example"

#: ../../env_modules.rst:246
msgid ""
"生产环境下环境路由跑在一个专用的 Ray actor 里（``EnvRouterProxy``），所有 agent 共享一份 "
"环境状态；也可在进程内直接用 ``CodeGenRouter``。除默认的 ``CodeGenRouter`` 外还有 "
"``ReActRouter`` / ``PlanExecuteRouter`` / ``TwoTierReActRouter`` / "
"``TwoTierPlanExecuteRouter`` / ``SearchToolRouter`` 可选（见 "
":doc:`architecture`）。"
msgstr ""
"In production, environment routing runs in a dedicated Ray actor "
"(``EnvRouterProxy``), and all agents share the same environment state. "
"``CodeGenRouter`` can also be used directly in-process. In addition to "
"the default ``CodeGenRouter``, optional routers include ``ReActRouter``, "
"``PlanExecuteRouter``, ``TwoTierReActRouter``, "
"``TwoTierPlanExecuteRouter``, and ``SearchToolRouter`` (see "
":doc:`architecture`)."

